# PART 27 — SHARED BUSINESS WORKFLOWS

Implement complete workflows.

## Owner Registration

Register → Verify Account → Owner Dashboard → Add PG

## Property Publication

Create Property → Submit Location → Admin Verifies Location → Property Approval → Listing Entitlement → Public Listing

Location verification and property approval are independent review processes and may proceed in parallel.

Public publication requires all applicable conditions to be satisfied.

## Tenant Joining

Browse PG → Request Join → Owner Approves → Bed Assigned → Tenant Accepts Terms → Active Stay

## Rent

Generate Charge → Notify Tenant → Record Payment → Update Balance → Issue Receipt

## Checkout

Request Checkout → Review Dues → Resolve Settlement → Finalize Checkout → Release Bed → Preserve History

## Startup Events

Admin Creates Event → Publishes → Tenant/Owner Discovers → Registers → Admin Manages Registration → Event Completed

## Subscription

Select Plan → Initiate Payment → Verify Payment → Activate Entitlement → Manage Renewal or Expiry

Use proper state transitions.

Do not allow impossible or unauthorized transitions.

